- **Meta Rotation** ([42.3](https://pubg.com/en/news/10885)) changes which weapon
  CLASS is in focus about every four months, by balance; it takes no gun out of
  loot. [43.1](https://pubg.com/en/news/11057) cut RPD and M249 world spawns by 30%.
- **BZ Grenade Launcher** ([39.1](https://pubg.com/news/9466)) was an Erangel: Subzero
  item; 40.1 removed that map's items, so it is not in the catalog (58 items). It comes
  back here if a winter map returns.

### Console versus PC

PUBG publishes ONE patch note for PC and console; console goes live about 8 days
after PC. On 2026-10-24 both run 43.2 and **no weapon is on one platform only**.
The console differences are not weapons (bigger console hitboxes in 43.1, vehicle
recoil left unchanged on console in 42.3). **Mouse and keyboard on console are not
allowed:** KRAFTON calls them "unauthorized" and set harsher penalties from
2024-11-27 ([news/7986](https://pubg.com/en/news/7986)).

